    "description": "Designed by autonomist xenobotanists, these pods are bio-engineered from the predatory whiplash creatures found on the exoplanet Sunrise, with additional transgenic features. The primary modification made to the original creature was to turn the entire organism upside down and orient the digestive portion of the organism horizontally, so that the whiplash's tri-lobed orifice faces forward. The whiplash's grasping roots were also converted into even more motile \"walking tentacles.\"",
